resources (e.g., \code{url()}, \code{file()}, \code{s3()}, \code{remote()});
\item the data accessible to the server are limited to those accessible to
the ClickHouse \code{user}. Using a dedicated user with limited permissions
is recommended.
}

\strong{Available tools.}
\itemize{
\item \code{list_mdbs}: list the MDBs with their description and access level.
\item \code{search_tkcat}: search MDBs, tables and fields by keyword.
\item \code{describe_mdb}: general information, tables and relationships of an MDB.
\item \code{describe_tables}: detailed data model of MDB tables
(fields, types, keys, indexes, collection members).
\item \code{preview_table}: first records of a table or of a matrix.
\item \code{query_mdb}: run a read-only ClickHouse SQL query on an MDB.
\item \code{get_matrix_values}: get values from a matrix table.
\item \code{list_collections}: collections and their members used to integrate
